tmp-shot-*/
tmp-upload-*/
.devtools
# Anchored to apps/server/db/ only — a bare `db/` matches at ANY depth, which
# silently swallowed apps/server/src/company/db/ (see cd0c7ac91) and then
# apps/server/src/lib/simplicity/db/ (this fork's Simplicity port): git never
# shows gitignored files as untracked, so `git add .`/`git status` gave no
# signal that source had gone missing, and a clean checkout crash-looped on
# "Cannot find module .../db" until someone noticed. No apps/server/db/
# runtime directory currently exists — everything routes through
# getBrowserosDir() outside the repo — so this may not even be needed
# anymore, but keeping it anchored costs nothing and can't repeat that bug.
/db/
identity/
